<p>OakBridge Publishing is a new-age publishing and knowledge services organization, established with the objective of redeﬁning the craft of publishing to address the evolving requirements of today’s professionals and academia. The company is engaged in publishing authoritative content for professionals and academicians, delivering customized training and certiﬁcate courses, and organizing specialized events and conferences for knowledge exchange.</p>
<p>OakBridge publications have been released by distinguished dignitaries, including the former President of India, former Vice Presidents of India, Chief Ministers of States, Hon’ble Justices of the Supreme Court and various High Courts, Senior Advocates, and leaders from the tax and business fraternity. This recognition reﬂects the credibility and relevance of OakBridge’s publishing program within professional and academic domains.</p>
<p>Established in July 2017 by Mr. Shreesh Chandra and Mr. Vikesh Dhyani, both IIMB alumni, the company is led by professionals with extensive leadership experience in the publishing, knowledge, and information solutions industry. The founders bring deep expertise in conceptualizing, developing, and marketing professional content in the areas of law, taxation, and business.</p>
<p>In addition to publishing, OakBridge has successfully curated and hosted knowledge events of national importance. From high-proﬁle GST Summits to conferences on the Insolvency and Bankruptcy Code (IBC) and Arbitration, OakBridge has consistently provided platforms for deliberation and dialogue among industry leaders, policymakers, practitioners, and academicians.</p>
<p>With its commitment to excellence and innovation, OakBridge Publishing is not just creating books, but shaping ideas and conversations that drive progress.</p>
<p>For more information about OakBridge, its thought leadership publications, and its flagship event, VidhiUtsav - India's first and biggest Festival of Law, Legal Literature and Luminaries, visit <a target="_blank" href="https://www.oakbridge.in">www.oakbridge.in</a> and <a target="_blank" href="https://www.vidhiutsav.com">www.vidhiutsav.com</a>.</p>
